Band Description: A duo consisting of a disgraced cryo-biologist and a former rave promoter who found unity in a shared bunker. They perform behind glass partitions, manipulating liquid nitrogen-cooled synthesizers and antique metal strikers, embodying an aesthetic of sterile, clinical obsession.

